no/img/2015/12/15/9085014/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もいきまーす！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/15/9085014/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆遥吉さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁動物になれるとしたらどの動物になりたいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎犬です！犬がいい！！！犬語わかるようになりたいし、話したい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆はせがわさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁「卒業式にやってみたかったこと、ある？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎うーん、なんだろうー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"廊下を全力で走ることかな！\nあ！あと、体育倉庫のボールを\n無我夢中で全部体育館にだすこと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆りょうきちさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんですか？\nきぃちゃんですか？\nきんちゃんですか？\nきーちゃんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎正式にはきいちゃんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、なんでもいいですよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆工業男子のすがちゃんさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁キャップ派？ニット帽派？ベレー帽派？ハット派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎ニット帽とベレー帽！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆あくたさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁アンダーライブ武道館